---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Harry Sivasambu"
  description="Technical Project Manager portfolio: healthcare workflows, AI guardrails, and cloud delivery."
>
  <section id="about" class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Harry Sivasambu · Toronto, Canada</p>
    <h1>Technical Project Manager building reliable healthcare and cloud systems</h1>
    <p class="hero-description">Personal projects exploring AI guardrails, clinical workflows, and cloud delivery. I turn complex requirements into focused systems with clear boundaries and practical tradeoffs.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/blog">View Projects &amp; Writing</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://harry-sivasambu.com/">View Resume</a>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:reachouttoharry@gmail.com">Contact Me</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="featured-work" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Featured Work</h2>
    <div class="card featured-project">
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 0;">
        <h3 style="margin: 0 0 8px;">Clinical Alert Triage Assistant</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
          A simulated clinical alert workflow: rules set severity and routing, AI explains the result, and humans review.
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 0 0 12px; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
          <li>Kept severity and routing under deterministic control; the LLM only generates explanations</li>
          <li>Built a structured explainability standard covering the alert summary, contributing factors, uncertainty, and deterministic rule trace</li>
          <li>Added rules-only fallback, recorded human review and feedback, and an inspectable decision history</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center;">
          <a href="https://clinical-alert-triage-t7t1.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display: inline-block; padding: 8px 18px; background: var(--accent-solid); color: var(--on-accent); font-weight: 600; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">Try Live Demo →</a>
          <a href="/blog/clinical-alert-triage">Read case study →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog/clinical-alert-triage" class="project-image">
        <img
          src="/images/alert-triaging/alerts_Table.jpg"
          alt="Clinical alert triage alerts table"
          style="width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; display: block;"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="other-projects" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Other Projects</h2>
    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--accent);">Patient Logger App</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
        A clinical task-tracking prototype with server-side permissions, a PostgreSQL data model, and a multi-tenant extension in progress.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/patient-logger">Read case study →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--accent);">AWS Portfolio Infrastructure &amp; CI/CD</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted);">
        Imported a production-style AWS stack into Terraform, validated zero-drift, and automated deploys.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog/cloud-resume-challenge">Read case study →</a>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section id="experience" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Real-World Experience</h2>
    <div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500;">What I've delivered in production:</p>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
        <li>Led hospital software implementations valued at more than $3M, from scope through go-live</li>
        <li>Coordinated EHR/HL7, clinical communication, infrastructure, and data dependencies</li>
        <li>Led an Agile team developing an ML gait-analysis app; delivered a prosthetic workflow change that reduced production lead time by 30%</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="current-focus" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px;">Current Focus</h2>
    <div>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--muted);">
        <li>Deepening system design and cloud architecture skills</li>
        <li>Building production-style applications that reflect real-world constraints</li>
        <li>Exploring how AI systems integrate into operational workflows</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" style="margin-top: 28px;">
    <div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: var(--muted);">
        If you're working on complex systems where reliability and real-world constraints matter, let's connect.
      </p>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/hsivasambu">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hsivasambu/">LinkedIn</a></li>
        <li><a href="mailto:reachouttoharry@gmail.com">Email</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
